{"id":"anzug","lemma":"Anzug","pos":"noun","rank":1356,"glosses":["suit (of clothes), outfit","approach, gathering (of weather)","approaching, advancing"],"ipa":"/ˈantsuːk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/De-Anzug.ogg/De-Anzug.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Anzuges","plural":"Anzüge"},"formAudio":{"Anzüge":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-Anz%C3%BCge.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Passt dieser Anzug?","en":"Does this suit fit?","words":[{"g":"to fit","l":"passen"},{"g":"this one, this"},null]},{"text":"Er hat mir einen Anzug gemacht.","en":"He made me a suit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393715","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Das ist ein schöner Anzug.","en":"That's a beautiful suit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567117","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"well, beautifully","l":"schön"},null]},{"text":"Ich trage normalerweise keine Anzüge.","en":"I don't usually wear a suit.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},{"g":"normally"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Dieser Anzug ist mir zu groß.","en":"This suit is too big for me.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"big"}]}]}